      "content": "thanks for the info. i checked the vent/register and it looks okay, air is definitely coming out, it just doesnt feel cold enough. i was thinking maybe there's something actually stuck or breaking things inside the walls or the ducts themselves that we cant see. like, is there any way something could be causing a sudden drop in pressure or air flow in just that one line?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
